== Notes ==
*Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
* This feat will displace a single instance of each of ''[[expeditious retreat]]'', ''[[haste]]'', and ''[[mass haste]]'', provided those spells had been cast by the character.
*This feat cannot be selected when taking a level of [[Harper scout]].
* The haste effect is subject to [[dispel]]ling. The effective caster level is the character's total [[hit dice]].

== Custom content notes ==
* A custom class must have this feat in their feat list, or that class will not be able to select it as a general feat.
* ''script:'' <code>X2_S2_BlindSpd</code>
